5,1,1,talk,Servas,,"It is a pleasure to be with you all. To ensure we build on a firm foundation, I wish to see what we have learned from the past.","{""words"":28,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,1,1,talk,Daisuke,,Um... hello. I'm worried about the costs. I want to make sure we can actually afford whatever we choose without surprises later.,"{""words"":22,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,1,1,talk,Sakura,,Hi everyone! I want to know if the places we're working at are actually ready for us! It's like trying to paint a wall that isn't there!,"{""words"":27,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,1,1,talk,Ryuji,,We often prioritize flashy goals. I want to see the actual daily losses and errors occurring on the floor to find a practical solution.,"{""words"":24,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,1,1,talk,Asuka,,We must be realistic about human resources. I am concerned that we treat staff time as an infinite resource without considering the actual burden.,"{""words"":24,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,1,2,talk,Servas,,"@Daisuke, your caution is wise. Balance is the key to longevity. Let us look at both the financial limits and the historical outcomes.","{""words"":23,""mentions"":[""Daisuke""],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,1,2,talk,Daisuke,,I... I agree. I just don't want us to realize next year that we spent money we didn't have.,"{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,1,2,talk,Sakura,,"@Asuka, do you think the people are too tired? Maybe that's why things get messy! I'm curious about how we handle the outside stuff too!","{""words"":25,""mentions"":[""Asuka""],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,1,2,talk,Ryuji,,"@Sakura, ""messy"" is exactly the point. We need to quantify the time lost to inefficiency rather than guessing based on feeling.","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[""Sakura""],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,1,2,talk,Asuka,,"Precisely, @Ryuji. If a proposal requires more manpower than we have available, it is a failure before it even begins.","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[""Ryuji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
15,1,3,talk,Servas,,"Wisdom comes from recognizing patterns. If we ignore the ghosts of previous failures, we are doomed to dance with them again.","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
16,1,3,talk,Daisuke,,I'll look into the budget... and maybe the vendor pricing. I just want to be safe.,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
17,1,3,talk,Sakura,,I'm going to check the network coverage at the plants! And maybe how we handle those vendor queries. Let's find the mysteries!,"{""words"":22,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
18,1,3,talk,Ryuji,,I will focus on the incident logs and the time lost to copying records. The truth is in the waste.,"{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
19,1,3,talk,Asuka,,I will investigate the in-house developer availability and the staffing of the coordination group. We need to know who is actually doing the work.,"{""words"":24,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
20,1,4,talk,Servas,,I shall examine the outcomes of the last three rollouts and the record of cross-unit standardization. Let us seek a sustainable path.,"{""words"":22,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
